<title>USA: Media General sells newspaper.</title>
<headline>Media General sells newspaper.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Media General said it has completed the sale of The Daily Pioneer in Bemidji, Minn., for about $10.68 million to Forum Communications, Inc.</p>
<p>Media General is an independent, publicly owned communications company situated primarily in the Southeast with interests in newspapers, broadcast and cable television, recycled newsprint production, and diversified information services.</p>
</text>
